{title: Kar Chale Hum Fida}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Madan Mohan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
Kar cha[Am]le hum fi[G]da
jaan-o-tann sathiy[C]on
Ab tu[Am]mhare ha[G]wale
wa[F]tan sathi[Am]yon..

{c: Verse 1}
Saans[A]thambti gayi nabs jamti gayi
Phir bhi[D]badhte
[A]kadam ko na rukne diya
Kat[A]gaye sir humare to kuch gham nahi
Sar[D]Himalaya ka[A]humne na jhukne diya
Marte[Am]marte ra[G]ha baakpan sathi[C]yo
Ab tu[Am]mhare ha[G]wale
wa[F]tan sathi[Am]yo

{c: Verse 1}
Kar cha[Am]le hum fi[G]da
jaan-o-tann sathiy[C]on
Ab tu[Am]mhare ha[G]wale
wa[F]tan sathi[Am]yon..

{c: Verse 1}
Zinda[A]rehene ke mausam bohot hain magar
Jaan[D]deneki[A]rutt roz aati nahin
Husn[A]aur ishq dono ko ruswa kare
Woh[D]jawani jo[A]khoon mein nahati nahi
Aaj[Am]dharti[G]bani hai dulhan saythi[C]yo
Ab tu[Am]mhare ha[G]wale
wa[F]tan sathi[Am]yo

